<section class="card" data-role="dcaSummary">
  <h2>DCA Strategy</h2>

  <div style="background:var(--surface-light);border-left:3px solid var(--primary);padding:1rem;margin:0 0 1rem 0;border-radius:4px">
    <h3 style="margin:0 0 0.5rem 0;font-size:1rem">What is DCA?</h3>
    <p style="margin:0 0 0.75rem 0;color:var(--muted)">
      Dollar-Cost Averaging (DCA) is an investment strategy where you purchase fixed amounts of a security at regular intervals,
      regardless of the security's price. This approach reduces the impact of market volatility and removes the pressure of timing
      the market perfectly.
    </p>

    <h3 style="margin:0 0 0.5rem 0;font-size:1rem">How This Tool Works</h3>
    <ul style="margin:0 0 0.75rem 0;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--muted)">
      <li>Automatically detects recurring purchases (DCA patterns) in your transaction history</li>
      <li>Compares your actual DCA returns against a hypothetical lump-sum investment on your first purchase date</li>
      <li>Shows consistency metrics to reveal how disciplined your DCA approach has been</li>
      <li>Breaks down purchase history with running average cost to show how DCA smooths entry prices</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 style="margin:0 0 0.5rem 0;font-size:1rem">When to Use DCA</h3>
    <ul style="margin:0 0 0;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--muted)">
      <li><strong>New investors:</strong> Remove emotion from entry timing; build positions gradually</li>
      <li><strong>Limited capital:</strong> Invest what you can afford at regular intervals</li>
      <li><strong>Volatile markets:</strong> Reduce the risk of buying at market peaks</li>
      <li><strong>Long-term wealth building:</strong> Benefit from compound growth and market cycles</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.8rem;margin:0 0 0.75rem 0">Auto-detected dollar-cost averaging patterns with lump-sum comparison</p>
  <div class="card-grid" data-role="dcaCards"></div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-role="dcaChartSection" style="display:none">
  <h3 data-role="dcaChartTitle">DCA vs Lump Sum</h3>
  <div class="chart-wrap" style="height:280px">
    <canvas data-role="dcaChart"></canvas>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-role="dcaTableSection" style="display:none">
  <h3>DCA Patterns Detected</h3>
  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table data-role="dcaTable" class="data-table sortable"></table>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="card" data-role="dcaDetailSection" style="display:none">
  <h3 data-role="dcaDetailTitle">Purchase History</h3>
  <div class="chart-wrap" style="height:240px">
    <canvas data-role="dcaDetailChart"></canvas>
  </div>
  <div class="table-scroll" style="margin-top:1rem">
    <table data-role="dcaDetailTable" class="data-table"></table>
  </div>
</section>
